        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers in excess of 399,000.\n\nA beautifully presented, A-rated three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home extending to approximately 118 sq. m. (1,270 sq. ft.), finished to an exceptional standard throughout and ideally positioned within the exclusive Chestnut Hill development.\n\nNo. 13 Chestnut Hill is a superb modern family home which has been meticulously maintained and thoughtfully upgraded by its current owners. Freshly painted both internally and externally, the property is presented in immaculate, turn-key condition, with stylish décor and quality finishes evident throughout.\n\nFrom the moment you enter, the standard of presentation is immediately apparent. The welcoming entrance hallway features attractive wood-effect tiled flooring and contemporary wall panelling, setting the tone for the beautifully finished accommodation beyond.\n\nThe generously proportioned sitting room is particularly impressive, centred around a stunning bespoke media wall with decorative panelling, television and integrated electric fire, creating an elegant and inviting focal point.\n\nTo the rear, the impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area is perfectly suited to modern family living. The contemporary fitted kitchen incorporates extensive floor and eye-level cabinetry, quartz worktops and splashback, integrated Bosch appliances, electric hob and extractor, with sliding doors opening directly onto the westerly facing rear garden. A separate utility room, guest WC and excellent storage complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the bright landing benefits from a large picture window and leads to three well-proportioned bedrooms. The master bedroom is beautifully appointed with fitted sliding wardrobes and feature wall panelling, together with a luxurious fully tiled ensuite. Bedrooms two and three are both generously sized, while the stylish family bathroom is finished with quality tiling and a modern vanity unit. A separate walk-in wardrobe off the landing provides excellent additional storage.\n\nExternally, No. 13 enjoys a westerly facing rear garden, incorporating a paved patio, lawn, garden shed and finished cement boundary walls. The garden provides an ideal private setting for outdoor dining and family enjoyment. To the front, a generous paved driveway provides parking for two vehicles, with side access also available.\n\nChestnut Hill is an exclusive development of just 46 superior homes, set within beautifully landscaped grounds and offering a peaceful and attractive residential environment. Its location is exceptional, being just minutes from Wexford Town Centre and providing easy access to the N25, N11 and M11 road networks.\n\nEveryday amenities are close at hand, including Clonard Village, Wexford Retail Park, Whitford House Hotel & Leisure Centre, supermarkets, cafés, pharmacies, sports facilities and schools. Families will particularly appreciate the proximity to local primary and secondary schools, including the new Loreto Secondary School, while South East Technological University is also within easy reach.\n\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, Johnstown Castle Museum & Gardens and the Forth Mountain walking trails are approximately 5km away, while Rosslare Strand is just 15km from the property.\n\nWith its exceptional presentation, impressive specification, A-rated energy efficiency and superb location, No. 13 Chestnut Hill represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a high-quality contemporary home in one of Wexford's most desirable residential developments.\n\nFeatures\nA-rated, energy-efficient home\n3 bedrooms / 3 bathrooms\nApprox. 118 sq. m. / 1,270 sq. ft.\nBuilt in 2021\nImmaculately presented throughout\nFreshly painted internally and externally\nStylish decorative wall panelling\nBespoke media wall with integrated electric fire\nHigh-spec kitchen with quartz worktops\nIntegrated Bosch appliances\nLuxurious ensuite and family bathroom\nWesterly facing rear garden\nPrivate patio and lawn\nGarden shed\nSide access\nParking for two vehicles\nAir-to-water heating\nWired for EV charging\nFibre broadband available\nExclusive development of only 46 homes\nExcellent access to Wexford Town and N11/N25\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the exceptional quality, presentation and location of this outstanding home."
      },
